stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OwnedUnplaced: Acquire individual once
    OwnedUnplaced --> PlacedBlocked: Valid placement with no incompatible lock / evaluate blockers
    PlacedBlocked --> Contributing: Affinity and production conditions valid; all blockers clear
    Contributing --> PlacedBlocked: Hunger, sickness, recovery or disruption blocks work
    PlacedBlocked --> PlacedBlocked: Resolve one cause while another remains
    Contributing --> OwnedUnplaced: Recall or rescue / preserve individual
    PlacedBlocked --> OwnedUnplaced: Recall or rescue / preserve individual
    note right of PlacedBlocked
      Independent data: fullness, illness, recovery,
      disaster and encounter effects.
      Treating one cause does not clear the others.
      No death or rank-loss transition is specified.
    end note
